<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρᾱτ-ίζομαι</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκρᾱτος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drink neat
				wine</i>; hence, <i>breakfast</i>, because this consisted of
				<i>bread dipped in wine</i> (<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.11c
			</span></i> sq.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				295
			</span></i>, ubi v. Sch., <i><span class="en">
				Canthar.
				8
			</span></i>: c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κοκκύμηλα</span>
			<i>to breakfast on</i> plums, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				607
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristomen.
					14
				</span></i>
			: metaph., c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμιγοῦς ἠκρατίσω σοφίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.166
				</span></i>
			:—later in 
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίζω</span>, fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶ</span>, <i>entertain at
			breakfast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἐφήβους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					113.41
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτιζέτω καὶ ἀκρατιζέτω ψυχάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.103
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
